NCBI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"Q8NFA0","text":"Deubiquitinase that can remove conjugated ubiquitin from target proteins, such as RAB7A and LAMTOR1 (PubMed:36476874). Acts as a positive regulator of the mTORC1 signaling by mediating deubiquitination of LAMTOR1, thereby promoting the association between LAMTOR1 and the lysosomal V-ATPase complex and subsequent activation of the mTORC1 complex (PubMed:36476874)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}